    '斑点窝':'Spotty brood','斑驳子脾':'Spotty brood','雄蜂子脾':'Drone brood','其他':'Other',
    '平静':'Calm','普通':'Normal','正常':'Normal','防御性':'Defensive','攻击性':'Aggressive',
